{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.28, "to": 2.82, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "你是否还在因为定位不准而痛失好局", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.82, "to": 5.2, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "是否还在苦恼微调训练没有效果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.2, "to": 8.32, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "那你是否想过是你瞄准的根基出现了问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.32, "to": 11.46, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "本视频将从四个步骤带你逐步巩固根基", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.46, "to": 13.72, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "让你回到往日的神勇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.63, "to": 15.65, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "东西还给我", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.65, "to": 16.69, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "还剩一名", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.69, "to": 17.41, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "第一步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.41, "to": 20.91, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "我们需要学会基础的定位能力与定位意识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 20.91, "to": 23.1, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "打破右手的瞄准惰性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.1, "to": 25.62, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "这里推荐的是aim lab的六目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.62, "to": 27.42, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "或者靶场的侧面版", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.42, "to": 30.6, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "让我们先清楚自己的瞄准处于什么水平", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.6, "to": 32.14, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "在进行定位的同时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.14, "to": 35.42, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "要学会用余光观察下一个要打的目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.42, "to": 39.06, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "但是注意不要为了追求成绩而刻意的发力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.06, "to": 42.5, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "务必追求与自己实战的发力方式一致", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.5, "to": 44.0, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "不然分数提升了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.0, "to": 46.7, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "但是对实战的帮助并没有多少", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.7, "to": 47.48, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "第二步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.48, "to": 49.5, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "我们来到靶场抓两个黑奴", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.5, "to": 50.62, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "然后拿出鬼魅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.62, "to": 52.98, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "保持在五到10米的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.98, "to": 55.06, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "在两个霸塔之间进行拉枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.06, "to": 55.769, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "单点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.769, "to": 57.609, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "每个bot点一发头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.609, "to": 58.649, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "若是没点中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.649, "to": 59.969, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "也必须切换目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.969, "to": 61.31, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "不追求速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.31, "to": 64.89, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "要确保自己认为的中心已经瞄到了bot的头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 64.89, "to": 65.61, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "再开枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.61, "to": 67.32, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "然后继续换目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.32, "to": 69.62, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "切记不要单目标连点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.62, "to": 72.44, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "那会通过弹道找到中心点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.44, "to": 74.42, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "这相当于借助了外力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.42, "to": 77.22, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "对我们的中心感提升是微乎其微的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.22, "to": 80.9, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "我们使用建议幻影侍卫这三把枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.9, "to": 82.92, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "进行同样的反复操作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.92, "to": 86.19, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "强化我们对不同枪械的手感与中心感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.19, "to": 89.19, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "因为不同的枪械模型和持枪视角", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.19, "to": 91.71, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "都会影响我们对中心感的判断", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.71, "to": 93.229, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "当都熟练了以后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.229, "to": 95.769, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "我们便可以加入急停限制摆设", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.769, "to": 97.429, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "来进阶自己的中心感", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.429, "to": 100.49, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "自然我们还可以加入正常的练枪手段", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.49, "to": 102.51, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "譬如在喇嘛的冰墙后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 102.51, "to": 104.53, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "pick打无准星的闪身枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.53, "to": 105.85, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "或许移动吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.85, "to": 108.51, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "下一步便是强化中心感的存在", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.51, "to": 110.29, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "我们可以来到乱斗模式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.29, "to": 111.63, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "仍然是无准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.63, "to": 113.78, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "各种枪械可以自由选择", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.78, "to": 115.59, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "通过无准星的死斗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 115.59, "to": 117.99, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "可以寻找不同地图中的爆头线", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 117.99, "to": 119.27, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "在练习的过程中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.27, "to": 122.7, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "我们会经常性的在开枪前专注中心的位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.7, "to": 125.8, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "这样更是能强化到我们对身位控制的训练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.8, "to": 127.74, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "一边开枪寻找中心点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.74, "to": 128.66, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "一边移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.66, "to": 130.449, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "保持自身安全位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.449, "to": 132.149, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "在每天训练完成后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 132.149, "to": 134.409, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "都需要来到实战进行转化", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.409, "to": 135.549, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "我们进到游戏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.549, "to": 136.99, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "开启久违的准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 136.99, "to": 140.95, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "你便会发现瞄准简直就是天生的神力", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.95, "to": 142.63, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "好像", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.3, "to": 146.94, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "什么狗不快也摄像头", "music": 0.9999998333333612}, {"from": 146.94, "to": 147.64, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "这拉出来吗", "music": 0.9999998076923448}], "bvid": "BV1ASXwBGEeL", "title": "屏幕中心感？瞄准的底层逻辑！", "owner": "Kagome阿篱", "duration": 152}